LOCUS       4821_v5lp_phru3_forind-extgag_RSV_Long_F_GS4Opt_4aaCTdel 11780 bp ds-DNA     circular     19-JUN-2024
DEFINITION  .
COMMENT     same as 4733_v5lp_phru3_forind-extgag_RSV_Long_F_GS4Opt except with 4aa ct del
			Made by Teagan V5 landing pad-compatible pHrU3 ForInducible vector
            containing Extended Gag (Humes) with RSV Long F codon optimization
            by GenScript GS4, fourth codon opt from GS, cloned from a
            synthesized gene fragment. Plasmid was generated by digesting p4016
            with AscI/MluI and combining with RSV fragment via HiFi Assembly.
            Sequence validated using Primordium whole plasmid sequencing.
